{
  "rule": "mixed_deriv_2nd_nonuniform",
  "metric": "Linf",
  "expected_min_order": 1.9,
  "notes": "4-point non-uniform mixed cross-derivative D_x D_y u = (u[i+1,j+1] - u[i+1,j-1] - u[i-1,j+1] + u[i-1,j-1]) / ((dx[i]+dx[i+1])*(dy[j]+dy[j+1])). Denominator equals the full 2D stencil span in each direction; reduces to 4*dx*dy on uniform grids. O(h^2) theory; require observed min order >= 1.9 on independently geometrically-stretched grids."
}
